    "en": "Live road traffic in France (open data): national roads, Rennes, Nantes, Strasbourg, Bordeaux.",
    "fr": "Trafic en temps réel (open data) : routes nationales, Rennes, Nantes, Strasbourg, Bordeaux.",
    "de": "Echtzeitverkehr in Frankreich (Open Data): Nationalstraßen, Rennes, Nantes, Straßburg, Bordeaux.",
